        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 38,
        "raw": "[name=\"Suzuran\"]  Isn't this place eerily quiet?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Suzuran",
        "content": "Isn't this place eerily quiet?"
    },
    {
        "id": 39,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_358_lisa_1#3\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#3\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "raw": "[name=\"Folinic\"]  Yes. Stay close.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Folinic",
        "content": "Yes. Stay close."
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "raw": "[name=\"Folinic\"]  I'm seeing plenty of Infected among the citizenry, but that's not the main point.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Folinic",
        "content": "I'm seeing plenty of Infected among the citizenry, but that's not the main point."
    },
    {
        "id": 42,
        "raw": "[name=\"Folinic\"]  I was thinking about it when we fought those rioters before. This residential district is pretty ordinary in design, isn't it?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Folinic",
        "content": "I was thinking about it when we fought those rioters before. This residential district is pretty ordinary in design, isn't it?"
    },
    {
        "id": 43,
        "raw": "[name=\"Folinic\"]  They've just gathered up all the Infected to live together. There's nothing explicitly discriminatory about it.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Folinic",
        "content": "They've just gathered up all the Infected to live together. There's nothing explicitly discriminatory about it."
    },
    {
        "id": 44,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_358_lisa_1#3\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#3\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 45,
        "raw": "[name=\"Suzuran\"]  Hm...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Suzuran",
        "content": "Hm..."
    },
    {
        "id": 46,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_358_lisa_1#3\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#4\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 47,
        "raw": "[name=\"Folinic\"]  But the truth is they're still having their personal freedom restricted. And aside from a few remarkable Infected, most people live more or less like prisoners.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Folinic",
        "content": "But the truth is they're still having their personal freedom restricted. And aside from a few remarkable Infected, most people live more or less like prisoners."
    },
    {
        "id": 48,
        "raw": "[name=\"Folinic\"]  What they have is not a prison, but an entire street of cells with a dozen times more inmates.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Folinic",
        "content": "What they have is not a prison, but an entire street of cells with a dozen times more inmates."
    },
    {
        "id": 49,
        "raw": "[name=\"Folinic\"]  Look here, how long do you think it's been since this bakery was open?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Folinic",
        "content": "Look here, how long do you think it's been since this bakery was open?"
    },
    {
        "id": 50,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_358_lisa_1#3\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#3\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 51,
        "raw": "[name=\"Suzuran\"]  Ew... I think I saw an Originium slug crawling around... so unsanitary.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Suzuran",
        "content": "Ew... I think I saw an Originium slug crawling around... so unsanitary."
    },
    {
        "id": 52,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_358_lisa_1#3\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#3\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 53,
        "raw": "[name=\"Folinic\"]  No one's been sweeping up the dust and leaves around the door. There's no functioning economy here. No daily life.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Folinic",
        "content": "No one's been sweeping up the dust and leaves around the door. There's no functioning economy here. No daily life."
    },
    {
        "id": 54,
        "raw": "[name=\"Folinic\"]  I understand they've fallen on hard times, but no one wants to buy or sell bread? There's no public transit? This isn't normal.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Folinic",
        "content": "I understand they've fallen on hard times, but no one wants to buy or sell bread? There's no public transit? This isn't normal."
    },
    {
        "id": 55,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_358_lisa_1#3\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#3\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 56,
        "raw": "[name=\"Suzuran\"]  Maybe, maybe it's because of what happened before? Like the shop owner got scared off or something?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Suzuran",
        "content": "Maybe, maybe it's because of what happened before? Like the shop owner got scared off or something?"
    },
    {
        "id": 57,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_358_lisa_1#3\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#3\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 58,
        "raw": "[name=\"Folinic\"]  At least they have the right to live, they—",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Folinic",
        "content": "At least they have the right to live, they—"
    },
    {
        "id": 59,
        "raw": "[CameraShake(duration=1, xstrength=10, ystrength=12, vibrato=30, randomness=90, fadeout=true, block=false)]",
        "type": "camera_shake",
        "duration": "1,",
        "xstrength": "10,",
        "ystrength": "12,",
        "vibrato": "30,",
        "randomness": "90,",
        "fadeout": "true,",
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "id": 60,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_358_lisa_1#3\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 61,
        "raw": "[name=\"Suzuran\"]  Shh! Miss Folinic...! Lower your voice!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Suzuran",
        "content": "Shh! Miss Folinic...! Lower your voice!"
    },
    {
        "id": 62,
        "raw": "[Dialog]",
        "type": "dialog_marker"
    },
    {
        "id": 63,
        "raw": "[Character]",
        "type": "character"
    },
    {
        "id": 64,
        "raw": "[name=\"Townsfolk\"]  ......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Townsfolk",
        "content": "......"
    },
    {
        "id": 65,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_358_lisa_1#3\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#4\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 66,
        "raw": "[name=\"Folinic\"]  I wasn't criticizing them. I was just talking about... those 'armed Infected.'",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Folinic",
        "content": "I wasn't criticizing them. I was just talking about... those 'armed Infected.'"
    },
    {
        "id": 67,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_358_lisa_1#3\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#4\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 68,
        "raw": "[name=\"Suzuran\"]  Do you think they're...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Suzuran",
        "content": "Do you think they're..."
    },
    {
        "id": 69,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_358_lisa_1#3\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#3\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 70,
        "raw": "[name=\"Folinic\"]  That policeman mentioned 'Sarkaz.' We need to look into that first.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Folinic",
        "content": "That policeman mentioned 'Sarkaz.' We need to look into that first."
    },
    {
        "id": 71,
        "raw": "[name=\"Folinic\"]  If they do have anything to do with the 'armed Infected groups' we know, we'll have to tread carefully. Things here may be far more complicated than that policeman knows.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Folinic",
        "content": "If they do have anything to do with the 'armed Infected groups' we know, we'll have to tread carefully. Things here may be far more complicated than that policeman knows."
    },
    {
        "id": 72,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_358_lisa_1#3\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#3\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 73,
        "raw": "[name=\"Suzuran\"]  Really?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Suzuran",
        "content": "Really?"
    },
    {
        "id": 74,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_358_lisa_1#3\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#3\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 75,
        "raw": "[name=\"Folinic\"]  If the Infected are living well enough, it's only because the situation isn't desperate enough.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Folinic",
        "content": "If the Infected are living well enough, it's only because the situation isn't desperate enough."
    },
    {
        "id": 76,
        "raw": "[name=\"Folinic\"]  They must be hiding something from us.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Folinic",
        "content": "They must be hiding something from us."
    },
    {
        "id": 77,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_358_lisa_1\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#3\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 78,
        "raw": "[name=\"Suzuran\"]  Folinic?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Suzuran",
        "content": "Folinic?"
    },
    {
        "id": 79,
        "raw": "[name=\"Suzuran\"]  Please don't worry. Atro is very smart.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Suzuran",
        "content": "Please don't worry. Atro is very smart."
    },
    {
        "id": 80,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_358_lisa_1\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#4\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 81,
        "raw": "[name=\"Folinic\"]  I...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Folinic",
        "content": "I..."
    },
    {
        "id": 82,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_358_lisa_1\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#4\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 83,
        "raw": "[name=\"Suzuran\"]  You've been looking very scary since that meeting. But don't worry.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Suzuran",
        "content": "You've been looking very scary since that meeting. But don't worry."
    },
    {
        "id": 84,
        "raw": "[name=\"Suzuran\"]  As long as we try really, really hard, we'll be able to handle this, just like the senior operators!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Suzuran",
        "content": "As long as we try really, really hard, we'll be able to handle this, just like the senior operators!"
    },
    {
        "id": 85,
        "raw": "[name=\"Suzuran\"]  So can you relax for me? At least a bit?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Suzuran",
        "content": "So can you relax for me? At least a bit?"
    },
    {
        "id": 86,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_358_lisa_1\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#2\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 87,
        "raw": "[name=\"Folinic\"]  Aw, is little Lisa comforting me again? Why's that?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Folinic",
        "content": "Aw, is little Lisa comforting me again? Why's that?"
    },
    {
        "id": 88,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_358_lisa_1\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#2\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 89,
        "raw": "[name=\"Suzuran\"]  Hehe, let go of all your troubles, big and small!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Suzuran",
        "content": "Hehe, let go of all your troubles, big and small!"
    },
