    {
        "id": 95,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_069#4\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#4.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 96,
        "raw": "[name=\"Tatjana\"]  Doctors, please wait a moment—!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Tatjana",
        "content": "Doctors, please wait a moment—!"
    },
    {
        "id": 97,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_345_folnic_1#3\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 98,
        "raw": "[name=\"Folinic\"]  It's you.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Folinic",
        "content": "It's you."
    },
    {
        "id": 99,
        "raw": "[name=\"Folinic\"]  Didn't I say we don't need any help? All we need is access...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Folinic",
        "content": "Didn't I say we don't need any help? All we need is access..."
    },
    {
        "id": 100,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_069#4\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#3\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#4.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 101,
        "raw": "[name=\"Tatjana\"]  I'm sorry. I know you said as much, Miss Folinic, but considering the circumstances, and your unfamiliarity with this place, we have to take precautions to guard against potential accidents.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Tatjana",
        "content": "I'm sorry. I know you said as much, Miss Folinic, but considering the circumstances, and your unfamiliarity with this place, we have to take precautions to guard against potential accidents."
    },
    {
        "id": 102,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_358_lisa_1#3\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#3\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 103,
        "raw": "[name=\"Suzuran\"]  ...Miss Folinic?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Suzuran",
        "content": "...Miss Folinic?"
    },
    {
        "id": 104,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_358_lisa_1#3\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#4\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 105,
        "raw": "[name=\"Folinic\"]  Fine... The locals may be more welcoming if we have one of their own with us.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Folinic",
        "content": "Fine... The locals may be more welcoming if we have one of their own with us."
    },
    {
        "id": 106,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_069\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#4\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 107,
        "raw": "[name=\"Tatjana\"]  That's true! *Cough cough*! Zwölftontechnik Strasse was once Wolumonde's biggest Infected quarter...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Tatjana",
        "content": "That's true! *Cough cough*! Zwölftontechnik Strasse was once Wolumonde's biggest Infected quarter..."
    },
    {
        "id": 108,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_069\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#4\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 109,
        "raw": "[name=\"Folinic\"]  And now, for certain reasons, it's become Wolumonde's number one protest district.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Folinic",
        "content": "And now, for certain reasons, it's become Wolumonde's number one protest district."
    },
    {
        "id": 110,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_069#2\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#4\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#2.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 111,
        "raw": "[name=\"Tatjana\"]  Then what do you plan to do now?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Tatjana",
        "content": "Then what do you plan to do now?"
    },
    {
        "id": 112,
        "raw": "[name=\"Tatjana\"]  I don't think it's wise to go any deeper into this place... But if you want to learn more about the situation in Wolumonde, that is a good choice.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Tatjana",
        "content": "I don't think it's wise to go any deeper into this place... But if you want to learn more about the situation in Wolumonde, that is a good choice."
    },
    {
        "id": 113,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_069#2\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#4\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#2.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 114,
        "raw": "[name=\"Folinic\"]  Let's just go for a stroll here. No need to rush things.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Folinic",
        "content": "Let's just go for a stroll here. No need to rush things."
    },
    {
        "id": 115,
        "raw": "[name=\"Folinic\"]  I'd be very happy if you were willing to tell me more about Dr. Atro.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Folinic",
        "content": "I'd be very happy if you were willing to tell me more about Dr. Atro."
    },
    {
        "id": 116,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_069#2\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#4\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#2.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 117,
        "raw": "[name=\"Tatjana\"]  You... really worry about Dr. Atro, don't you?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Tatjana",
        "content": "You... really worry about Dr. Atro, don't you?"
    },
    {
        "id": 118,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_069#2\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#4\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#2.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 119,
        "raw": "[name=\"Folinic\"]  We went to school together. And she is one of my very few trusted friends. Not to mention an employee Rhodes Island can't afford to lose.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Folinic",
        "content": "We went to school together. And she is one of my very few trusted friends. Not to mention an employee Rhodes Island can't afford to lose."
    },
    {
        "id": 120,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_069#2\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#4\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#2.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 121,
        "raw": "[name=\"Tatjana\"]  ...I see.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Tatjana",
        "content": "...I see."
    },
    {
        "id": 122,
        "raw": "[name=\"Tatjana\"]  Ah, please come this way. Schaukelplatz is just up ahead.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Tatjana",
        "content": "Ah, please come this way. Schaukelplatz is just up ahead."
    },
